=== Test 07: Floats & Math ===
pi = 3.141593
e  = 2.718282
pi + e = 5.859874
pi * e = 8.539734
sin(0) = 0.000000 (expect 0.0)
cos(0) = 1.000000 (expect 1.0)
sqrt(144) = 12.000000 (expect 12.0)
pow(2,10) = 1024.000000 (expect 1024.0)
7 * 2.0 = 14.000000 (expect 14.0)
|5.0| = 5.000000
|-3.5| = 3.500000
=== Test 07 complete ===
